ompute, storage, and cloud native and networking services; and Akamai App Platform, provides ready-to-run templates that address challenges in deploying, managing and scaling Kubernetes clusters at scale. In addition, it offers delivery solutions that include web and mobile performance solutions, which enables dynamic websites and applications, as well as global traffic management, site acceleration, application load balancing, large-scale load testing, and real-user monitoring; and media delivery solutions, including video streaming and video player services, game and software delivery, broadcast operations, authoritative domain name system, resolution, and data and analytics. The company has a strategic alliance with Deloitte Canada to help organizations achieve platform-based resilience against AI-accelerated cyberthreats. Akamai Technologies, Inc. was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","employees":11000,"website":"https://www.akamai.com","country":"United States","city":"Cambridge","officers":[{"name":"Dr. F. Thomson Leighton","title":"Co-Founder, CEO, President & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Edward J. McGowan CPA","title":"Executive VP, CFO & Treasurer"},{"name":"Mr. Adam  Karon","title":"COO & GM of Cloud Technology Group"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.12,"tpe":31.43,"ps":4.812,"pfcf":27.73,"peg":1.145,"pb":5.056,"ev_ebitda":19.99,"rev_growth":0.177,"eps_growth":0.339,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2264,"eps_growth_next":0.1929,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1195,"roa":0.04674,"de":32.62,"gross_margin":0.5331,"op_margin":0.1128,"profit_margin":0.08604,"current_ratio":1.798},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":14.54,"sector":18.12,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":36.01,"sector":31.43,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.304,"sector":4.812,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":20.11,"sector":27.73,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.14,"